  "review": {
    "gallery": "Nine native developer renders visually matched to the 36-page official brochure. The same Motor City elevation appears on the listing card and detail hero.",
    "location": "Official physical page 11 has both the project-marked regional map and the nine estimates. Directions use the project name because the published position is schematic.",
    "floorPlans": "All 24 named units checked against their exact printed area panels. The dedicated 101 Properties plan book is a broker mirror. Its twelve plan spreads pixel-match the official brochure when rendered at 1400 × 700. Physical pages 5–21 match official brochure pages 18–34 by a thirteen-page offset. Tower B 1 BR Type 02 has inconsistent printed metric components and the total remains as published. Silver Stone consultant physical page 6 shows the full retail ground floor."
